  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPD. Improving migration data management capacities of national institutions in Lebanon II. 2022-2024.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve the migration management capacities of relevant institutions in Lebanon by contributing to improved migration data handling capacities of MoFA and the Security Operations Centre (SOC). In practice this will entail development of a MoFA archiving system for migration related files (e.g. consular issues, engagement with Lebanese abroad, visas, readmission, passport issuance and international relations) to allow for greater efficiency, lower cost, and data safety. It will also entail strengthening of SOC capacities to mitigate loss of system functionality to allow for secure exchanges of migration related data.</narrative>
  </description>
